sequenceDiagram
actor Staff as "Operator/Admin"
participant UI as "Interface: UI"
participant API as "mainController: Controller"
participant Service as "refundService: Service"
participant DB as "PostgreSQL: Database"
Staff->>UI: Create refund obligation with external reference
UI->>+API: POST /api/v1/refunds
API->>Service: createRefund(obligation, evidence)
Service->>DB: Validate remaining refundable cap and save PendingRefund
Staff->>UI: Upload execution evidence
UI->>+API: POST /api/v1/refunds/{id}/evidence
API->>Service: attachEvidence()
Service->>DB: Set AwaitingVerification
Staff->>UI: Admin verifies external refund
UI->>+API: POST /api/v1/refunds/{id}/verify
API->>Service: verifyRefund()
Service->>DB: Set Refunded and append audit
API-->>-UI: Refund completed record
Note over Service,DB: FSCM records the externally executed refund; it does not call PayOS refund automatically.

